<title>UK: BankAmerica unit sets 1.25 billion mark bond.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica unit sets 1.25 billion mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKAMERICA CREDIT CARD CORP SERIES 1996-1</p>
<p> AMT    1.25 BLN DEM  COUPON     **	  LEGAL MAT   15.NOV.05</p>
<p> TYPE   ASSET-BACKED  ISS PRICE  **	  EXP MAT     15.OCT.03</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    **	  PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED AT 34 B.P. OVER SEPT 2003 BUND</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CAY/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.95	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	BACKED BY CLASS A FLOATING RATE CERTIFICATE SERIES</p>
<p>		1996-B ISSUED BY BA MASTER CREDIT CARD TRUST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
